{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Keep an eye on rabbits, protect them from foxes or destroy the population.</strong><br><strong>For the glory of the Goddess!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner of a rabbit farm you have a dream: to become the best breeder and attract the attention of the Rabbit Goddess. She gives you land and in return asks for a small favor. Complete tasks to gain her trust. But hurry up: the Goddess is impatient, and does not like to wait long.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cute fluffy rabbits\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026breed uncontrollably. They also get sick and die. Don`t leave the rabbits for a long time, they need you. Put rabbits of different colors in the same lawn to get a new coloring. Occasionally the goddess wants something unusual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/35105d80d2bf319cd7cb7ec6a35381ed.poster.avif?t=1767670283\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/35105d80d2bf319cd7cb7ec6a35381ed.webm?t=1767670283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Beware of foxes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They enter the farm to feast on your dependents. Separate the rabbits from the foxes if you don't want them to die. However, sometimes foxes can be quite useful...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/eabb632393973b70333a8e74578bb48c.poster.avif?t=1767670283\" width=256 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/eabb632393973b70333a8e74578bb48c.webm?t=1767670283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139350?t=1767670283","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139350?t=1767670283","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/3a75f3414d82ba6b4b71ff2c8d69b88ee33638b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767670283","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/3a75f3414d82ba6b4b71ff2c8d69b88ee33638b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767670283","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4141650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Keep an eye on rabbits, protect them from foxes or destroy the population.</strong><br><strong>For the glory of the Goddess!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner of a rabbit farm you have a dream: to become the best breeder and attract the attention of the Rabbit Goddess. She gives you land and in return asks for a small favor. Complete tasks to gain her trust. But hurry up: the Goddess is impatient, and does not like to wait long.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cute fluffy rabbits\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026breed uncontrollably. They also get sick and die. Don`t leave the rabbits for a long time, they need you. Put rabbits of different colors in the same lawn to get a new coloring. Occasionally the goddess wants something unusual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/35105d80d2bf319cd7cb7ec6a35381ed.poster.avif?t=1767670283\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/35105d80d2bf319cd7cb7ec6a35381ed.webm?t=1767670283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Beware of foxes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They enter the farm to feast on your dependents. Separate the rabbits from the foxes if you don't want them to die. However, sometimes foxes can be quite useful...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/eabb632393973b70333a8e74578bb48c.poster.avif?t=1767670283\" width=256 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/extras/eabb632393973b70333a8e74578bb48c.webm?t=1767670283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["NullMoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139350/3a0a7cacf582d1b693e3513195ed8ddf65610e5d/header.jpg?t=1767670283","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.